Read `docs/architecture/08-ai-analysis-and-debrief.md` and
`docs/architecture/09-security-and-access-control.md` before changing analysis
or publication code.

Fail closed for private role/facilitator data. Treat participant and Observer
payloads as distinct projections. Durable `AiAnalysisPublication` snapshots
and `AiAnalysisPublicationGrant` rows are the current authorization boundary:
require an active grant bound to current account/session membership and enforce
its stored maximum projection server-side. Do not reconstruct legacy grants or
use display names as the authorization key for personal feedback. The
authoritative contract is `docs/architecture/08-ai-analysis-and-debrief.md`.
